# A waiting question is never ended by a tap elsewhere (Boss, 2026-10-29: a mis-tap while typing his own answer
# hit a queued mail's [ send now ], which ended the turn: "the question wasn't answered").
# Fictional phone-builder question (four choices, Other allowed) with a fictional mail queued behind it; no agent runs.
# Checks: no [ send now ] while the question waits; what he typed in Other stays through back, leaving the app and a
# restart; the question still waits; only Send answers it.
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell run-as dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview rm -f files/oma-question-drafts.json
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion builder --ez queuedBehind true
clearlog
expect Questions waiting
expect queued →
expect cancel
absent send now
shot question-draft-no-send-now-cover
tap answer questions
expect Questions · 4
scrollto Write your answer
tap Write your answer
type Keep the Manga look
expect Keep the Manga look
# Off the form: the keyboard goes, then back to chat. Nothing is sent or skipped.
key BACK
key BACK
wait 800
expect Questions waiting
absent send now
nolog fixture send now
nolog phone builder question allow
tap answer questions
expect Before I continue
expect Keep the Manga look
shot question-draft-kept-cover
# Leave the app and come back.
key HOME
wait 1000
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion builder --ez queuedBehind true
wait 1000
expect Questions waiting
tap answer questions
expect Keep the Manga look
# A restart of the app: the draft is read back from disk.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion builder --ez queuedBehind true
expect Questions waiting
absent send now
tap answer questions
expect Before I continue
expect Keep the Manga look
expect 3 of 4 questions left
shot question-draft-after-restart-cover
nolog fixture send now
nolog phone builder question allow
fold unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion builder --ez queuedBehind true
expect Questions waiting
absent send now
tap answer questions
expect Keep the Manga look
# A tap on the chat beside the form (the mis-tap): the form and its draft stay, nothing is sent.
tap Fictional mail queued behind the question
wait 800
expect Before I continue
expect Keep the Manga look
absent send now
nolog fixture send now
nolog phone builder question allow
shot question-draft-kept-unfolded
shell run-as dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview rm -f files/oma-question-drafts.json
[phone] After the bundle: a phone builder asks Boss a harmless one-question AskUserQuestion while an agent mail is queued behind it. The queued mail shows [ cancel ] but no [ send now ]. He types in Other, taps beside the form, goes home, reopens Soma, and the text is still in Other; the builder is still waiting (no "not answered"); Send delivers his typed answer once.
[phone] Same on a Mac thread's question from the Soma desktop app: type in Other, close the form, quit and reopen the app: the text is still there and the thread still waits.
